Q2 Q the user closes the window, scene loops shown: no Listening Room process ended in a native crash (20 runs)
Q3 Q the user closes the window, scene loops shown: every process ended as its path expects, on its own within 15 s (20 runs; slowest @@ s)
Q4 Q the user closes the window, scene loops shown: no scene loop is torn down on the way out: no Gtk.MediaFile cleared, re-opened or finalized and no GstPlay thread ended, up to the last Python atexit handler (20 runs)
